# Declarative tab/pane layouts applied on worktree.created, including starting a
# coding agent and handing it a prompt once herdr reports it ready. Needs a Rust
# toolchain: its shim builds with cargo on first use and its manifest has no
# build hook to fetch a prebuilt, unlike herdr-lazy's.
